Reconstruction: pack content is synthesized orientation notes from RG 1.97
Rev. 5 pinned facts (dual-source verified pin, 2026-11-09) and the closed
list of framework statements in the spec. RG verbatim excerpts are capped
at two sentences by licence policy; this pack contains zero quotations.
IEEE Std 497-2016 and NUREG-0700 are named only, with designation and
edition, and their text is never reproduced here. No HSI design guidance,
no instrumentation design how-to, and no variable list or design detail
appear in this pack.

